  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Voodoo Lady (slower version)** (1 other source): Performed at a much slower tempo than usual [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Play It Off Legit**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Pollo Asado**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Mango Woman**: back after 74 archived shows (2675 days); rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **LMLYP**: back after 47 archived shows (2219 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2016-11-27** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 148 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Gener played megaphone on Stallion Part 1, Stroker Ace, and the Licking the Palm into Mushroom Festival pairing; two listed songs went unplayed [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2016-11-27**: Taped by fred moore using Schoeps MK-41 mics into a Roland R-44 recorder, edited in Samplitude, released as FLAC [1]",
